<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b><i>Alexey Vinogradov</i></b> has served as
a member of our Board since July 2019. Dr. Vinogradov currently works as Business Development Manager at Mag. Peter G. Wahl&#8217;s Law
Firm in Vienna, Austria, which focuses on corporate, property and commercial law. Dr. Vinogradov has extensive experience in business
