<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b>Director Compensation</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b>&#160;</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Each of our non-employee, independent directors
is currently entitled to receive an annual retainer of $43,000, payable in equal quarterly installments, an option to acquire 2,500 shares
of the Company&#8217;s common stock upon initial appointment to the Board, and an additional option to acquire 2,500 shares each year
thereafter on the date of the later of the Company&#8217;s annual meeting of stockholders and December 31<sup>st</sup> of each year. All
members of our Board are reimbursed for their usual and customary expenses incurred in connection with their service on the Board, including
out-of-pocket expenses, transportation, and airfare on the Company&#8217;s business.</p>

